SUMMARY:Aries Spears LIVE at Funny Bone Comedy Club - Omaha (Fri Early)
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nAries Spears LIVE at Funny Bone Comedy Club – Omaha\nGet ready for a night of non-stop laughs as stand-up comedy powerhouse Aries Spears takes the stage at Funny Bone Comedy Club in Omaha\, Nebraska. Known for his razor-sharp wit and explosive energy\, Aries Spears delivers a comedy experience you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Funny Bone Comedy Club – Omaha\nAddress: 710 N 114th St\, Suite 210\, Omaha\, NE 68154\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nTicket Price: $37 – $42 \nAbout Aries Spears\nAries Spears is a veteran stand-up comedian and actor best known for his long run on MADtv\, where his uncanny celebrity impressions made him a household name. With decades of experience on stage and screen\, Spears brings a high-energy\, no-holds-barred style to every performance. He has appeared on numerous TV specials and continues to tour nationally to sold-out crowds. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a MADtv legend\nHilarious celebrity impressions and sharp observational humor\nAn intimate comedy club atmosphere at Omaha’s Funny Bone\nFull bar and dinner menu available\nA night of laughs you’ll be talking about for weeks\n\nVenue Information\nFunny Bone Comedy Club – Omaha is located at 710 N 114th St\, Suite 210 in Omaha\, Nebraska. The club features a full bar and dinner menu\, offering a complete entertainment experience in an intimate setting perfect for live comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets for the Friday 7:00 PM early show start at $37. Seating is general admission. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/aries-spears-live-at-funny-bone-comedy-club-omaha-fri-early/
LOCATION:Funny Bone Comedy Club – Omaha\, 710 N 114th St Suite 210\, Omaha\, NE\, 68154
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/fe8/f5d847b2-3439-4e8f-8b98-efc6f1cb9fe8_RETINA_LANDSCAPE_16_9.jpg
GEO:41.2661592;-96.093382
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Funny Bone Comedy Club – Omaha 710 N 114th St Suite 210 Omaha NE 68154;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=710 N 114th St Suite 210:geo:-96.093382,41.2661592
END:VEVENT
