SUMMARY:Jerry Seinfeld LIVE at OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJerry Seinfeld LIVE at OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nComedy legend Jerry Seinfeld returns to the OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino in Niagara Falls for an evening of iconic stand-up comedy. The creator and star of Seinfeld delivers razor-sharp observations about everyday life that have made him one of the greatest comedians of all time. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nAddress: 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Falls\, ON L2G 3Y5 \nAbout Jerry Seinfeld\nJerry Seinfeld is one of the most successful comedians in history\, best known for co-creating and starring in the iconic TV series Seinfeld. He has been performing stand-up comedy for over four decades and continues to tour extensively\, delivering his signature observational humor to sold-out audiences worldwide. \nWhat to Expect\n\nIconic observational comedy from a living legend\nRazor-sharp wit and perfectly crafted jokes\nA world-class venue experience at Fallsview Casino\nStunning Niagara Falls backdrop\nAn unforgettable night of comedy history\n\nVenue Information\nThe OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino is a premier entertainment venue at 6366 Stanley Ave in Niagara Falls\, Ontario. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $103. Don’t miss this rare opportunity to see a comedy legend live! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
