SUMMARY:Shane Gillis & Special Guests LIVE at Lincoln Financial Field
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Shane Gillis\nShane Gillis is one of the hottest names in stand-up comedy today. The Pennsylvania native — born and raised in Mechanicsburg\, PA — has become a cultural phenomenon\, selling out arenas and stadiums across the country with his unapologetically bold\, blue-collar humor. His comedy is raw\, honest\, and deeply rooted in the American experience\, resonating with audiences who appreciate comedy that doesn’t pull its punches. \nGillis gained national attention through his podcast “Matt and Shane’s Secret Podcast” and his stand-up specials\, including “Live in Austin” and “Beautiful Dogs” on Netflix. He returned to Saturday Night Live as a host in 2024 to massive acclaim\, cementing his status as one of the defining comedic voices of his generation. This Lincoln Financial Field show is a homecoming of sorts — Gillis performing in his home state of Pennsylvania for one of the biggest comedy events the city has ever seen. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM \nVenue: Lincoln Financial Field — 1 Lincoln Financial Field Way\, Philadelphia\, PA 19148 \nTicket Prices: $30 – $268 (plus fees; premium suites available) \nAbout Lincoln Financial Field\nLincoln Financial Field — affectionately known as “The Linc” — is the iconic home of the Philadelphia Eagles and one of the most recognizable sports and entertainment venues in the United States. Located at 1 Lincoln Financial Field Way in South Philadelphia\, the stadium holds approximately 69\,000 fans and offers a world-class entertainment experience at every level. \nThe Linc features multiple concourse levels with food and beverage options\, premium club spaces\, luxury suites\, and state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems. For a comedy show of this scale\, the production will be designed to ensure every fan — from the front row to the upper deck — has an incredible experience. The stadium’s massive video boards and sound system make it one of the most technically impressive venues in the country. \nParking is available in the stadium’s surrounding lots (advance purchase recommended for major events). The venue is accessible via SEPTA’s Broad Street Line (AT&T Station) and by car via I-95 and I-76. This is a massive event — plan to arrive early and enjoy the full stadium atmosphere. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is not just a comedy show — it’s a historic event. Shane Gillis performing at Lincoln Financial Field represents one of the largest stand-up comedy shows ever staged in Philadelphia. Expect a full evening of Gillis’s signature brand of comedy\, joined by a lineup of special guests that promises to make this an unforgettable night. \nThe energy of a stadium crowd experiencing live comedy together is unlike anything else in entertainment. Whether you’re a longtime Gillis fan or just looking for the biggest comedy event of the summer\, this show delivers on every level. Grab your tickets early — this one will sell out. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $268 (plus applicable fees; premium suites from $205) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). This is one of the most anticipated comedy events of 2026 — don’t miss it! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/shane-gillis-and-special-guests-live-at-lincoln-financial-field/
LOCATION:Lincoln Financial Field\, 1 Lincoln Financial Field Way\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 19148\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/c9c/72c0dadb-0756-4489-9fdb-573562cf5c9c_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
GEO:39.903058;-75.1665428
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Lincoln Financial Field 1 Lincoln Financial Field Way Philadelphia PA 19148 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1 Lincoln Financial Field Way:geo:-75.1665428,39.903058
END:VEVENT
