SUMMARY:Rodney Carrington LIVE at Turfway Park
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nRodney Carrington is a multi-talented comedian\, actor\, and country music artist who has been making audiences laugh for over two decades. Known for his outrageous\, adult-oriented humor and his ability to blend stand-up comedy with live musical performances\, Rodney has built one of the most loyal fanbases in the comedy world. \nHis comedy albums have gone platinum\, his TV series Rodney ran on ABC\, and his live shows are legendary for their high energy\, crowd interaction\, and the kind of no-holds-barred humor that keeps fans coming back year after year. Rodney’s unique style — part stand-up\, part musical comedy — makes every show a one-of-a-kind experience. \nWhether he’s strumming his guitar or delivering rapid-fire punchlines\, Rodney Carrington delivers an evening of pure\, unfiltered entertainment that leaves audiences in tears of laughter. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026\nTime: 9:00 PM\nVenue: Turfway Park\, 7500 Turfway Road\, Florence\, KY 41042\nAge Restrictions: Ages 21 & over only\nTicket Price Range: $84 – $150\n\nAbout the Venue\nTurfway Park is a premier entertainment and racing destination located in Florence\, Kentucky\, just south of Cincinnati. The venue offers a unique outdoor concert and event experience set against the backdrop of one of the region’s most storied horse racing facilities. \nLocated at 7500 Turfway Road in Florence\, KY\, the venue is easily accessible from both Louisville and Cincinnati\, making it a great destination for fans from across the region. The outdoor setting creates a lively\, festive atmosphere perfect for a late-night comedy show. \nAmple parking is available on-site at Turfway Park. Please note this is a 21+ event — valid photo ID is required for entry. Dress comfortably for an outdoor summer evening show. \nWhat to Expect\nRodney Carrington delivers a high-energy\, adults-only stand-up and musical comedy performance. This is a full headline show featuring Rodney’s signature blend of raunchy humor\, country music\, and crowd-pleasing entertainment. \nExpect plenty of audience interaction\, live guitar performances\, and the kind of outrageous comedy that has made Rodney one of the most beloved performers on the touring circuit. This is a late-night show — perfect for a summer Friday night out with friends. \nDoors typically open before showtime. Arrive early to grab drinks and find your spot before Rodney takes the stage for an unforgettable evening of comedy and music. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $84 to $150 depending on seat location. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeats. Must be 21+ to attend. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/rodney-carrington-live-at-turfway-park/
LOCATION:Turfway Park Racing & Gaming\, 7500 Turfway Road\, Florence\, KY\, 41042
