SUMMARY:Andrew Dismukes LIVE at Punch Line Philly (Late Show)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Andrew Dismukes\nAndrew Dismukes is a rising star in stand-up comedy\, best known as a cast member on Saturday Night Live. His sharp character work and absurdist humor made him a fan favorite on the show\, and his live performances take that energy to a whole new level. \nA Texas native\, Dismukes brings a deadpan yet high-energy style to the stage\, blending clever wordplay with unexpected physical comedy. His stand-up is filled with self-deprecating storytelling and ridiculous premises built to their most hilarious conclusions. \nThis late show is perfect for night owls who want to cap off their Friday with a night of world-class comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026 \nShow Time: 9:15 PM (Late Show) \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restrictions: 18+ (valid ID required) \nContent Warning: Adult language and themes \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s premier stand-up comedy club\, nestled in the Northern Liberties neighborhood at 33 E. Laurel Street. The intimate venue holds approximately 300 guests and is purpose-built for comedy — with excellent sightlines\, top-notch acoustics\, and a lively atmosphere. \nThe club features a full bar and food menu\, so you can enjoy cocktails\, craft beers\, and bites throughout the show. The late show crowd tends to be especially energetic\, making for a fantastic shared experience with fellow comedy fans. \nParking is available nearby\, and the venue is easily accessible by public transit. Punch Line Philly consistently delivers world-class stand-up in an intimate setting that larger venues simply can’t match. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is the late show performance by Andrew Dismukes — a solo stand-up set running approximately 60–75 minutes. Expect the same high-energy\, laugh-packed performance as the early show\, with Dismukes known for keeping the energy electric from the first joke to the last. \nDoors open approximately 30 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to grab a drink and settle in. A two-drink minimum applies at most tables. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $52 – $112 (fees included) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Late shows often sell out quickly — don’t miss out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-philly-late-show-july-seventeen/
LOCATION:Punch Line Philly\, 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 19123\, United States
