SUMMARY:The Second City "The Best of The Second City" LIVE at Birchmere
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThe Second City “The Best of The Second City” LIVE at Birchmere\nThe legendary Second City comedy troupe brings their acclaimed “Best of The Second City” revue to the iconic Birchmere in Alexandria\, VA for one unforgettable night of sketch comedy\, improv\, and laughs. This touring production showcases the very best material from one of the most celebrated comedy institutions in the world — the birthplace of legends like Tina Fey\, Stephen Colbert\, and Bill Murray. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Birchmere\nAddress: 3701 Mt. Vernon Ave\, Alexandria\, VA 22305\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome (everyone requires a ticket)\nParking: Free on-site parking available \nAbout The Second City\nThe Second City is the world’s premier comedy club\, theater\, and school of improvisation\, founded in Chicago in 1959. With alumni including Tina Fey\, Stephen Colbert\, Bill Murray\, John Belushi\, Gilda Radner\, and dozens more comedy legends\, The Second City has shaped modern comedy for over six decades. Their touring productions bring the best of their revue-style sketch comedy to audiences across North America. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA high-energy evening of sketch comedy and improvisation from one of comedy’s most storied institutions\nHilarious scenes\, songs\, and characters drawn from The Second City’s legendary catalog\nA talented ensemble cast of performers trained in the Second City tradition\nSharp\, witty commentary on modern life delivered with expert comedic timing\nAn intimate setting at the beloved Birchmere venue in Alexandria\nA show suitable for comedy fans of all backgrounds and ages\n\nVenue Information\nThe Birchmere is one of the most beloved music and comedy venues in the Washington\, DC area\, located at 3701 Mt. Vernon Ave in Alexandria\, VA. Known for its intimate atmosphere and excellent sightlines\, the Birchmere offers free on-site parking and a full-service bar and restaurant. The venue is fully handicap accessible. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $55 (face value) or $70.20 through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are also available through VividSeats. There is an 8-ticket limit per order. Will Call opens at 5 PM the night of the show. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/the-second-city-the-best-of-the-second-city-live-at-birchmere/
LOCATION:Birchmere\, 3701 Mt. Vernon Ave\, Alexandria\, VA\, 22305\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/e/f4e/b36c09ad-3149-4fb7-a029-1c722a438f4e_RETINA_PORTRAIT_16_9.jpg
GEO:38.839991;-77.0613932
