SUMMARY:Rodney Carrington LIVE at MGM Northfield Park - Center Stage
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nRodney Carrington is one of America’s most beloved comedians — a blue-collar entertainer who combines stand-up comedy with country music in a way that is uniquely\, hilariously his own. Born and raised in Texas\, Carrington has been making audiences laugh and sing along for over three decades. \nHis breakthrough came with the 1998 album Hangin’ With Rodney\, and he has since released eight comedy albums\, starred in his own ABC sitcom Rodney\, co-written and co-starred with Toby Keith in the feature film Beer For My Horses\, and released a Netflix special Here Comes the Truth. He is consistently ranked among America’s Top 10 highest-grossing comedians. \nFans can expect a raucous\, laugh-out-loud night of stand-up comedy and musical comedy\, featuring Rodney’s signature songs and stories about life\, love\, and everything in between. His shows are known for being wildly funny and genuinely heartfelt — a rare combination that keeps fans coming back year after year. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM \nVenue: MGM Northfield Park – Center Stage\, 10777 Northfield Road\, Northfield\, OH 44067 \nAge Restriction: \nAbout the Venue\nMGM Northfield Park – Center Stage is Northeast Ohio’s premier casino entertainment venue\, located just 20 miles south of Cleveland inside the MGM Northfield Park complex off I-271 in Northfield\, Ohio. \nCenter Stage offers a world-class entertainment experience with excellent sightlines\, a full-service bar\, and the lively atmosphere of a casino showroom. The venue’s intimate layout ensures every seat delivers a great view of the stage\, making it one of the best places in the region to catch a live comedy show. \nAmple on-site parking\, easy highway access\, a full casino floor\, and multiple dining options throughout the complex make MGM Northfield Park the ideal destination for a complete evening of entertainment in Northeast Ohio. \nWhat to Expect\nRodney Carrington delivers a full evening of stand-up comedy and musical comedy that blends laugh-out-loud jokes with his signature country songs. His shows are high-energy\, crowd-pleasing\, and packed with the kind of humor that makes you feel right at home. \nExpect an opener to kick off the night before Rodney takes the stage for a headlining set that covers everything from relationships and family to the absurdities of everyday life — all with his trademark Texas charm and comedic timing. \nNote: This is a 21+ event. Content is for mature audiences. Please bring valid government-issued ID. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $85 (prices may vary based on demand) \nSecure your seats through official Ticketmaster channels or find resale tickets via VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/rodney-carrington-live-at-mgm-northfield-park-center-stage/
LOCATION:MGM Northfield Park – Center Stage\, 10777 Northfield Road\, Northfield\, OH\, 44067\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/2a5/511e89de-d97c-4259-b7b9-d7c9724552a5_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg
GEO:41.348669;-81.5242506
