SUMMARY:Jerry Seinfeld LIVE at Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJerry Seinfeld LIVE at Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nOne of the greatest stand-up comedians of all time\, Jerry Seinfeld\, brings his legendary live show to the Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino in Mashantucket\, CT on July 18\, 2026. Known for his sharp observational humor and impeccable timing\, Seinfeld continues to sell out venues worldwide with his signature wit and storytelling. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM ET (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nAddress: 39 Norwich Westerly Road\, Mashantucket\, CT 06339\nAge Requirement: All Ages\nParking: On-site parking available \nAbout Jerry Seinfeld\nJerry Seinfeld is one of the most successful and beloved comedians in the world\, best known for co-creating and starring in the iconic NBC sitcom Seinfeld\, which ran from 1989 to 1998 and remains one of the greatest TV shows ever made. Beyond television\, Seinfeld has never stopped performing stand-up comedy\, releasing acclaimed specials including 23 Hours to Kill (2020) on Netflix. His observational comedy about everyday life\, relationships\, and the quirks of modern existence has made him a timeless voice in comedy. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWorld-class stand-up comedy from a true legend of the craft\nSharp\, observational humor about everyday life and human behavior\nImpeccable comedic timing honed over decades of performing\nAn intimate theater setting at the Premier Theater at Foxwoods\nA night of non-stop laughter you won’t soon forget\nOne of the most sought-after live comedy experiences of 2026\n\nVenue Information\nThe Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino is one of New England’s premier entertainment venues\, located within the world-famous Foxwoods Resort Casino in Mashantucket\, Connecticut. The theater offers excellent sightlines\, top-notch acoustics\, and a full-service casino resort experience before and after the show. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Jerry Seinfeld at Foxwoods start at $137. This is a highly anticipated show — tickets are expected to sell out quickly. Secure your seats now through official Ticketmaster or resale options via VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jerry-seinfeld-live-at-premier-theater-at-foxwoods-resort-casino/
LOCATION:Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\, 39 Norwich Westerly Road\, Mashantucket\, CT\, 6339\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/5f0ebea2-3344-4065-8ea3-1a9f6412b9d2_RETINA_LANDSCAPE_16_9-7ufweZ.jpg
GEO:41.4758112;-71.9626466
