SUMMARY:Maz Jobrani LIVE at Sound Board at MotorCity Casino Hotel
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nMaz Jobrani is one of the most celebrated Iranian-American comedians working today\, known for his sharp wit\, cultural observations\, and ability to bridge worlds through laughter. \nA founding member of the legendary Axis of Evil Comedy Tour\, Maz has built a career on turning his immigrant experience into universal comedy gold. His stand-up tackles everything from family dynamics and cultural clashes to politics and everyday absurdities — all delivered with warmth\, energy\, and precision timing. \nMaz has appeared on numerous TV shows and films\, including his own Netflix special “Brown and Friendly\,” and has been a regular on late-night television. His comedy resonates deeply with diverse audiences who appreciate his ability to find humor in the human condition regardless of background. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM \nVenue: Sound Board at MotorCity Casino Hotel \nAddress: 2901 Grand River Ave\, Detroit\, MI 48201 \nAge Restrictions: Please check venue for age requirements. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Sound Board at MotorCity Casino Hotel is one of Detroit’s premier intimate concert and comedy venues\, nestled inside the vibrant MotorCity Casino Hotel complex on Grand River Avenue. \nWith a capacity of approximately 1\,700 guests\, the Sound Board offers an exceptional viewing experience from virtually every seat in the house. The venue features state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems\, a full bar\, and a sophisticated atmosphere that sets the stage for an unforgettable night out. \nThe MotorCity Casino Hotel complex provides ample amenities including on-site parking\, multiple dining options\, and the full casino experience before or after the show. The venue is easily accessible from downtown Detroit and surrounding suburbs. \nWhat to Expect\nMaz Jobrani delivers a high-energy\, crowd-pleasing performance that blends personal storytelling with sharp social commentary. Expect plenty of laughs about cultural identity\, family life\, and the quirks of modern American society. \nHis shows are known for their inclusive atmosphere — Maz has a gift for making everyone in the room feel seen and heard\, regardless of their background. This is a solo stand-up performance\, so you’ll get a full evening of Maz at his best. \nThe intimate setting of the Sound Board means you’ll be close to the action\, making for a truly personal comedy experience. Arrive early to grab a drink and settle in before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $60 (resale prices may vary) \nSecure your seats now before they sell out. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/maz-jobrani-live-at-sound-board-at-motorcity-casino-hotel/
LOCATION:Sound Board at MotorCity Casino Hotel\, 2901 Grand River Ave\, Detroit\, MI\, 48201\, USA
