SUMMARY:Andrew Dismukes LIVE at Punch Line Philly (Saturday Late Show)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Andrew Dismukes\nAndrew Dismukes is one of the most exciting voices in stand-up comedy today. Best known as a cast member on Saturday Night Live\, Dismukes earned a devoted following with his sharp character work\, absurdist humor\, and impeccable comedic timing. \nA Texas native\, he brings a uniquely deadpan yet explosive energy to the stage. His live stand-up goes deeper than what you’ve seen on TV — expect personal storytelling\, ridiculous premises\, and a performance style that keeps the audience completely engaged from start to finish. \nThe Saturday late show at Punch Line Philly is the perfect way to end your weekend on a high note. Andrew Dismukes is guaranteed to deliver a night you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026 \nShow Time: 9:15 PM (Late Show) \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restrictions: 18+ (valid ID required) \nContent Warning: Adult language and themes \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s most celebrated comedy club\, located at 33 E. Laurel Street in the Northern Liberties neighborhood. The intimate venue holds approximately 300 guests in a setting designed specifically for stand-up comedy\, with excellent sightlines and acoustics from every seat. \nThe club features a full bar and food menu\, so you can enjoy cocktails\, craft beers\, and bites throughout the show. Saturday late shows at Punch Line Philly are legendary for their electric atmosphere — the crowd is always ready to have a great time\, and the energy in the room is unmatched. \nParking is available nearby\, and the venue is easily accessible by public transit. Punch Line Philly is consistently ranked among the best comedy clubs on the East Coast. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Andrew Dismukes running approximately 60–75 minutes. The Saturday late show crowd is always one of the most enthusiastic of the weekend\, creating an incredible shared experience between performer and audience. \nDoors open approximately 30 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to grab a drink and find your seat. A two-drink minimum applies at most tables. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $52 – $112 (fees included) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Saturday late shows sell out extremely fast — grab your tickets now before they’re gone! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-philly-saturday-late-show/
LOCATION:Punch Line Philly\, 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 19123\, United States
